  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T11:44:08.436635Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T12:01:58.623960Z",
  "totalBlocks": 16,
  "translatedBlocks": 16,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c21187877dc10aca",
      "translationZh": "大家好。我觉得目前的 LLM 基准测试框架只给你一些醒目的汇总数字，却没有提供工具，让你查看模型究竟是如何回答每一道题的（它们把所有内容都输出到 JSONL 或 Parquet 文件里，结果你光是为了读取答案，就得自己写代码）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ff7178f9aec938d",
      "translationZh": "所以我开发了 lm-eval-ledger：一个基准测试框架，可以运行基准测试、记录所有内容，并提供一个网页应用，让你查看和比较各个模型是如何回答每一道题的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a892de47bbc525df",
      "translationZh": "为了演示，我在单张 5090 上对三个模型进行了基准测试：Qwen3.5-9B、NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B（UD-Q4_K_XL GGUF）和 Gemma-4-12B-it（QAT w4a16）。看起来 Qwen 的思考时间远比另外两个模型长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9fb69fca534efbfe",
      "translationZh": "GPQA Diamond：Qwen 0.717，Nemotron 0.657，Gemma 0.601——但耗时分别为 2h26m、1h34m、1h19m",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "063bf49d30548992",
      "translationZh": "LiveCodeBench：Qwen 耗时 22h57m（另外两个分别为 9h51m / 6h13m），准确率为 0.713，另外两个分别为 0.837 / 0.820",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "266fcec4a092788c",
      "translationZh": "这里是由 lm-eval-ledger 在 Hugging Face Spaces 上展示的完整结果：https://huggingface.co/spaces/jayminbhan/lm-eval-ledger",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcc6f9b46a754f1c",
      "translationZh": "lm-eval-ledger 记录和展示的内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "67b1735f9d012faf",
      "translationZh": "每道题：系统提示词、模型生成内容、提取出的答案、标准答案、停止原因、生成内容的字符数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a2b6e4670cc7716",
      "translationZh": "每项基准测试：准确率、tok/s、完成耗时、样本数、未作答数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e998237c2b9695f",
      "translationZh": "附加功能：对两个模型在相同任务/问题上的表现进行两两比较，找出在多次基准测试运行中始终答错／始终答对的问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f553ab96dfdd7a0",
      "translationZh": "工作原理：所有内容都写入同一个 SQLite 数据库，并由一个 Flask 应用展示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "155a34a798d270da",
      "translationZh": "运行多模型 x 多任务评测也不再需要自定义 bash 脚本。lm-eval-ledger 由 YAML 驱动：复制 template.yaml，列出 N 个模型和 M 个任务，运行一条命令。就这么简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a30bd94693d0072f",
      "translationZh": "详细信息和完整任务列表见 GitHub 仓库：https://github.com/jayminbhan/lm-eval-ledger",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1df784e3e7f9fd8b",
      "translationZh": "我在 Linux 上验证了 vLLM / SGLang / HF / server (llama.cpp) 后端，并在 Windows 上验证了 HF / server (llama.cpp) 后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "522b9be0d57be080",
      "translationZh": "这个项目最初只是一个用来查看 GSM8K 中某个错误答案的脚本。结果越做越大，收不住了。非常欢迎任何反馈、想法或拉取请求！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "134520df6943d264",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/jayminban 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
